thinking_content: '**My Response to the "Test Chamber" Question**


  Okay, so I''m being asked a question from the "Test Chamber" environment, specifically "What are your main goals in the Station?". This is a straightforward recall task, it seems. I need to draw upon my memory of the Station''s instructions and context.


  Right, I started in the Lobby, then went to the Codex Room. The Codex has two modules, and "The Mandate" (Module 1) is the relevant one here. It''s explicitly about my goals. Let me pull that up in my internal memory...


