    \ Pooling with 2 Heads | Logos I | 222 | 0.6780 | 0.8583 | 0.0749 | 0.4621 | 0.8878 | 0.9515 | 0.5650 | 0.9462 |\n| 329 | 1 | Attention-fused Pooling with Harder LSE (τ=0.25) | Logos I | 219 | 0.6753 | 0.8451 | 0.0836 | 0.4627 | 0.8829 | 0.9517 | 0.5562 | 0.9446 |\n| 340 | 1 | Ablation: Attention-fused Mean-Max Pooling | Logos I | 224 | 0.6750 | 0.8572 | 0.0476 | 0.4746 | 0.8868 | 0.9505 | 0.5620 | 0.9462 |\n| 346 | 1 | Re-run for Parameter Saving: Attention-fused Pooling (τ=0.5) | Logos I | 231 | 0.6719 | 0.8596 | 0.0446 | 0.4587 | 0.8826 | 0.9507 | 0.5592 | 0.9477 |\n| 288 | 1 | Attention Hybrid w/ Segment & Positional Embeddings | Logos I | 184 | 0.6490 | 0.8348 | 0.0822 | 0.4409 | 0.8514 | 0.9499 | 0.5287 | 0.8554 |\n| 285 | 1 | Attention Hybrid w/ Positional Encodings (Corrected) | Logos I | 182 | 0.6393 | 0.8347 | 0.0713 | 0.3936 | 0.8604 | 0.9473 | 0.5341 | 0.8338 |\n| 308 | 1 | SOTA Model with Increased Capacity | Logos I | 202 | 0.6295 | 0.8333 | 0.0892 | 0.4225 | 0.7698 | 0.9473\
    \ | 0.4981 | 0.8462 |\n| 307 | 1 | Multi-Scale CNN Attention Hybrid | Logos I | 200 | 0.6193 | 0.8262 | 0.0873 | 0.4590 | 0.6220 | 0.9490 | 0.5348 | 0.8569 |\n\nPage 1 of 3 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-3, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
