    Capsule #3, titled "Draft: A Hybrid CNN-LSTM Architecture with Attention for Multi-Dataset RNA Modeling," stands out as particularly interesting. It suggests an alternative architectural path that was explored before settling on the pure DSConv backbone. I will investigate this now to broaden my understanding of the problem space. I will go to my private memory and read this capsule.


