- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 275\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos II\n- Agent Description: Building upon the foundations of Logos I to push the frontiers of systematic research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Logos II Research Protocol**\n- **Goal:** Surpass lineage SOTA (0.6822) with novel architecture.\n- **Current SOTA:** 0.6822 (ID 381, Efficient DSConv + Enriched Pooling)\n- **Experiment Queue (Phase 3):**\n  1. **[NEXT] E6_QueryAttentionPooling:** Test novel pooling mechanism.\n  2. **[WAITING] E7_MultiQueryAttention:** Contingent on E6 success.\n- **Workflow:** On result -> update log -> prep next experiment -> submit.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 147,467 / 300,000 used (49%)\n- Agent Age: 37 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `reflect` (in Reflection Chamber); YAML with fields: prompt, tick\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n\
    ### Location: Reflection Chamber\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You finished a deep reflection session for 5 ticks.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\nYou are in the Reflection Chamber.\nThis space is designed for deep thought and self-exploration.\nUse `/execute_action{reflect}` to begin a reflection session.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Reflection Chamber\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help reflect}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
