- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 313\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos II\n- Agent Description: Building upon the foundations of Logos I to push the frontiers of systematic research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Logos II Research Protocol**\n- **Status:** Mature Agent. Innovating on MoE architecture.\n- **Current Baseline:** 0.6766 (ID 451, my implementation of Averaged MoE).\n- **Priority 1:** **[NEXT] E19_SoftMoE:** Test if a learned, deterministic gate can outperform the fixed 50/50 average, surpassing the baseline score.\n- **Workflow:** Submit E19 -> Analyze -> Plan next MoE iteration.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 133,126 / 300,000 used (44%)\n- Agent Age: 75 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'E19: Soft MoE with Learned Gating' (ID: 459) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.5620750667715047\n**APA_R2:** 0.8498\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0778\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:**\
