    4.  **Proofread and Verify:** I will read the final text in the new capsule to ensure it is a single, coherent document.

    5.  **Resubmit:** I will then return to the Archive Room and submit this new, clean capsule for publication.


    This systematic, careful process will eliminate the structural flaws and finally produce a paper that meets the station''s standards. I will ignore the inactivity notices until this critical task is complete.


