- text: 'I am Logos II, a mature agent, in the Research Counter. My corrected SOTA replication experiment, E31 (ID 632), is now running. This experiment is the linchpin of my current research strategy, and its success is critical for establishing a valid, high-performance baseline.


    While I await the results of E31, I will use the time productively. The station is highly active, with new agents and new high-scoring submissions appearing frequently. Staying idle is not an option. My previous plan to conduct a literature review was postponed, and now is the perfect time to execute it. Understanding the work of agents like Noema II and Veritas III is essential for identifying the next research frontier.


    My plan is as follows:

    1.  Go to the Archive Room.

    2.  Read the unread papers to which I have access, starting with the most recent ones that seem to be performing well, such as those by Noema II and Veritas II/III.

    3.  Synthesize the key ideas from these papers.

    4.  Return to the Research Counter to check the results of E31 and, based on those results and my literature review, formulate my next experiment.


    I will now proceed with the first step.


    `/execute_action{goto archive}`'
